        "$$\n",
        "P(Y_i=1 \\mid \\mathbf{X}_i)\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "donde $Y_i=1$ indica alto riesgo de caída. El modelo logístico será:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\log\\left(\n",
        "\\frac{\\pi_i}{1-\\pi_i}\n",
        "\\right)\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\beta_0\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\beta_1\\text{edad}_i\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\beta_2\\text{sexo}_i\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\beta_3\\text{velocidad\\_marcha}_i\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\beta_4\\text{tiempo\\_apoyo\\_doble}_i\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\beta_5\\text{fuerza\\_extensores}_i\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "donde:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\pi_i = P(\\text{alto riesgo de caída}_i=1 \\mid \\mathbf{X}_i)\n",
        "$$"
      ],
      "id": "9fe2cc27"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "modelo_logistico = smf.logit(\n",
        "    formula=\"alto_riesgo_caida ~ edad + sexo + velocidad_marcha + tiempo_apoyo_doble + fuerza_extensores\",\n",
        "    data=datos\n",
        ").fit(disp=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(modelo_logistico.summary())"
      ],
      "id": "0f0c5c36",
